### 1. Check Server Status
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Send Sensor Data (POST)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/sensor-data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 42.5,
  "voltage": 230,
  "current": 3.5,
  "motorStatus": "ON",
  "fault": "NORMAL"
}

### 3. Get Latest Sensor Data (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/sensor-data/latest

### 4. Get All Sensor Data History (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/sensor-data
